  "details": "I was selecting stickers for Pride month, as it's currently June, and found that the flag designs on the glowsticks that VRRat is holding in one of the Pride 2025 stickers are inaccurate.\n\nThe trans flag has transposed the pink and white stripes.\n\nThe gay pride flag has moved the purple stripe from the bottom to the top.\n\nI'm not sure why an artistic choice would have been made to make the glowsticks *very nearly* but *not quite* the actual flag designs; they are not copyrighted, are fair use, and their designs have specific meaning behind them. Additionally, the pride flag butterfly in the same collection has the correct designs, as do the stripes on VRCat's DJ deck.\n\nThis should be a pretty simple correction to reupload, provided the artist still has the original file.",
